rule('capsule-blocking','Potential lines use tower world positions and Physics overlap-capsule radius 0.029999999329447746 in the GamePlayer1 layer. Any collider whose GameObject differs from both endpoint GameObjects blocks creation. Existing pair lookup happens before this new-line test.',[src('WayLineControl-GetWayLineEntity-100665560.txt','00270e25','00270ed5'),src('WayLineControl-GetOverlapCapsuleGameObj-100665583.txt','0018a3f7','0018a407'),src('WayLineControl-_oWgo__-100665571.txt','001d699e','001d6a16'),src('Layers-.cctor-100668000.txt') if (DIS/'Layers-.cctor-100668000.txt').exists() else src(next(DIS.glob('Layers-.cctor-*.txt')).name,'00821183','0082118b')],radius=0.029999999329447746,layer='GamePlayer1')
